== 1. a task that touches a visual: path sees the whole section, on ITS port ==
visual: web/* · this task touches it: yes
serve: dev 4007
shot: snap T-207 4007
port: 4007
proof: .polaris/shots/T-207-*.png — then READ it and write one "saw: <what it shows>" line in your handoff
read: ops/VISUAL.md
== 2. a task that does not touch it still sees the section — with touches it: no ==
visual: web/* · this task touches it: no
serve: dev 4000
shot: snap T-300 4000
port: 4000
proof: .polaris/shots/T-300-*.png — then READ it and write one "saw: <what it shows>" line in your handoff
read: ops/VISUAL.md
== 3. visual: unset ⇒ ONE line, and nothing else changes anywhere ==
(visual: unset — no capture step; ops/VISUAL.md explains how to add one)
